---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';

const pageTitle =
  "Disclaimer - AI Mr Ferdy";

const pageDescription =
  "Read the AI Mr Ferdy disclaimer regarding the use of AI-generated content, website information, digital tools, and user responsibilities.";
---

<MainLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  canonical={`${SITE.url()}/disclaimer`}
>

<section class="page-content">

<h2>Disclaimer</h2>

<p>
The information, tools, and services provided by AI Mr Ferdy are intended for general informational, educational, and productivity purposes only. While we strive to provide accurate and useful AI-powered assistance, we do not guarantee the completeness, accuracy, reliability, or suitability of any content generated through our platform.
</p>

<h2>AI-Generated Content</h2>

<p>
Content produced by artificial intelligence may contain inaccuracies, outdated information, or incomplete responses. Users are responsible for reviewing, verifying, and editing any AI-generated output before using it for academic, professional, legal, medical, financial, or other important purposes.
</p>

<h2>Educational Use</h2>

<p>
AI Mr Ferdy is designed to support learning, research, writing, and digital productivity. Users should ensure that any academic work created with the assistance of AI complies with the policies and ethical guidelines of their educational institution.
</p>

<h2>No Professional Advice</h2>

<p>
The content available on AI Mr Ferdy should not be considered professional advice. Nothing on this website constitutes legal, financial, medical, business, or other professional consultation.
</p>

<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
Our website may include links or references to third-party websites, services, or resources. AI Mr Ferdy is not responsible for the availability, accuracy, security, or content of external websites and does not endorse third-party products or services unless explicitly stated.
</p>

<h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>

<p>
AI Mr Ferdy shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of this website, its tools, or any AI-generated content. Users assume full responsibility for how they use the information provided.
</p>

<h2>Updates</h2>

<p>
This disclaimer may be updated periodically to reflect changes in our services, legal requirements, or platform improvements. Continued use of AI Mr Ferdy constitutes acceptance of the latest version of this disclaimer.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>

<p>
If you have any questions regarding this Disclaimer, please contact us through the official contact page available on AI Mr Ferdy.
</p>

</section>

</MainLayout>
